Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yieeey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.35,0:00:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.66,0:01:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off the merchandise, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think robot monkeys\Ncan't farf, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be the only way\Nto save us from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Torturing me is going to save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, man, you may hold the secret to\Nescaping from Noah's virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're back to\Nthinking I work for Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.09,0:01:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.05,0:01:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows it's you\Ntrapped in there, dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but we figure since your robot\Nbody was designed by Noah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,it may hold some clues about\Nhow to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So, cough up some answers, baboon boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop grabbing. There's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose my lucky number.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Something tells me it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey sleep now. That didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.95,0:02:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's some kind of code.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.57,0:02:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, maybe this\Nred button is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating primate\Nemergency escape sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.51,0:02:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's projecting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating virtual destination matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Passageway revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Program complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Land? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah may have tried his best to\Nrecreate my Duel Monsters theme park.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's obvious that this\Nis just a virtual rip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes White Train\Napproaching the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand behind the white line and please\Nlet all passengers off the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,before boarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Kaiba Lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:03:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,At least he got this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Step in and stand clear\Nof the closing door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This train better lead me to Moguba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All passengers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,who have stolen family empires from\Ntheir rightful owners, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare Where to exit at the next stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't believe a word he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my only brother, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like some kind of\NKaiba Corp amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Remind me never to waste my money here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where is Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down, will ya, RoboChimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruder alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.69,0:03:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruder alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-monsterized personnel\Nare forbidden to enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And just how are you gonna\Nstop us, you little metal burp?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been warned, intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tristan, you okay? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now leaving Kaiba Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to your final destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,For eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.39,0:04:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't mind the lava pits below.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.95,0:04:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Molten Rock is only 2,000 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.23,0:04:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right on schedule, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch your step while exiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want you to burn to\Nsmithereens before our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:05:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I want my brother back right\Nnow, you cowardly little runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, watch what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be much better off when I scatter\Nyour mind throughout cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The heat is on, Seto, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.19,0:05:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's time for me to do what\NI've been waiting to do for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove to myself and\Nprove to my father that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I am superior to you in\Nevery single way, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so great, why am I\Nthe president of Kaiba Corp?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of an unfortunate twist of\Nfate that never should have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm about to correct that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gozoburo Kaiba is my father, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And he always intended to\Npass his company on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep dreaming, kid. It's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your home movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you owe me some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this have happened? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:06:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can't do. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, they're talking about Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be some kind\Nof an old home movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They look pretty upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they so down about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to save him, we have to\Nact fast. Save him? You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds to me like Noah was\Nin some sort of an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You want the truth, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can handle the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you won't be here much\Nlonger anyway, so what's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, I haven't aged in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, this isn't really me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Noah is up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, your true stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That metal sphere above us is a shell, which\Nprotects and nourishes my living brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I found something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Train tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:07:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you guys are\Nthinking of following those tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Got any other ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find Kaiba and Mokuba, get\Nmy body back, and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could just\Nwait for the next train.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs a train when you\Ngot one of these bad boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice score, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we slow down a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak it out, you wimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.95,0:07:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms are too short to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know where the brakes are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, have either of you guys ever\Nseen one of these things before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,On TV once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is real life, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks like a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say your brain's\Nup there? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hardwired to a computer that\Nprojects a virtual image of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But things weren't always that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to be a normal kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A normal kid who had everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As the only child of a multi-billionaire,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afforded every luxury known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's servants\Nwaited on me hand and foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was groomed for success\Nfrom the time I could walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mathematicians and scientists from around
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the globe lined up for\Nthe chance to teach me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the son of the world's most powerful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Musicians, champion athletes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all lured to our front\Ndoor by my father, Gozoburo Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,with the sole purpose of\Nraising me into an educated,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,well-rounded future\Npresident of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, Seto, it was me who was destined\Nto run my father's company, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I would have, had it not\Nbeen for a freak accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:09:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me is\Nof little importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, my body\Nwas rendered useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but my mind was still sharp as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So my father used his company's\Ncutting-edge technology to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He linked my mind to a central computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,transforming my brainwaves\Ninto electromagnetic pulses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Every thought pattern, every memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,every bit of knowledge\NI had was digitized and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,downloaded into my father's\Nmainframe computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the end of my former life\Nas a human and the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,of my new life as a virtual\Nbeing whose power is limitless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after that, you came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.39,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Originally,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,father adopted you to\Nmotivate and challenge me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.83,0:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,as part of my training\Nto take over Kaivacorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.89,0:09:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was no longer possible, Although\NI was extremely powerful in cyberspace,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,with no body of my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't serve as the future\Npresident of my father's company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.15,0:10:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, Seto, I'm not human anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I exist only as a digital file in\Na supercomputer built by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But as soon as I defeat you in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Proving once and for all that\NI should be running KaibaCorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll upload my mind into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll fulfill my father's\Nwishes by taking over the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect me to believe\Nthat? Noah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing more ridiculous than\Nthat story is you outdueling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What better way to prove my power over you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,than by defeating you at\Nyour own pathetic game, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.87,0:10:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I rebuilt Kyber Corp from the ground up,\Non my own terms, with no help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That company is what it is because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else could run it,\Nespecially not some kid. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you real power. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then choose your card, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've already chosen my deck master.\NSay hello to my friend, Kaiser Seahorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you have no idea how long i've\Nbeen waiting for this seto
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,time to lose it all let's\Nduel i'll go first and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,now behold I summon Giant\NGerm in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll position this card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His first mistake was taking Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,His second was challenging me to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:11:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With my face down crush card\Non the field, he's finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When he attacks my Giant Germ, my\Ncrush card's power will activate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.51,0:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,destroying every monster in his hand and\Ndeck with 1500 attack points or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you got, Stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure, Seto, so stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Chiron the Mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I left my stomach\Nback in that last burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.43,0:12:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Define all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think we're\Nin Kaiba Land anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba versus Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Kaiba! Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your fan club has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And they came just in time to\Nwitness your last duel, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And my rebirth into the real world\Nas the new leader of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he can't let Noah win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the power of my mage\Nand his Mirror of Truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can remain hidden from me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.33,0:13:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,for the Mirror of Truth reveals your\Nface-down card and destroys it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see what you tried to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crush card is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, my mage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his giant germ!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant Germ, return to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's back, and you lose 500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your card's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.49,0:14:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be, but what makes you think\NI brought it back to attack you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed my Giant Germ in\Norder to summon my Vampire Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my creature of darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his Chiron the Mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,all Thanks to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,his special ability Every time\Nmy vampire sucks away some of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,your life points He forces\Nyou to send one of your cards
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,directly to the graveyard So say\Ngoodbye to another monster card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah At this rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,your deck will be empty\Nin no time I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that fanged\Nfreak of yours is about
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,to take his own trip to\Nthe card graveyard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have no monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said anything\Nabout using a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy him with this,\Nthe magic card fissure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, Batboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that you're\Ndefenseless, I'll play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's wide open for a direct attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, my heiress!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Seto's life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender now while you have the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Show that little green-haired\Ntwerp who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get away with this, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather see my company crumble to the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,ground than fall into\Nyour grubby little hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber Corp is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just taking back what belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep dreaming, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you might remember\Nmy old friend, Vampire Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You look surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know about vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:15:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My vampire lord possesses the\Npower of immortality, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.85,0:16:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So when he's sent to the\Ngraveyard, he comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Slate warrior in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought that I'd be rooting\Nfor Kyber, but let's go, rich boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in my world now, and\NI make the rules. Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you may think that you\Ncreated this virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you punk, But all you did\Nwas rip off my system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Vampire Lord, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your vampire has activated my trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So reveal the mighty Earthshaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for me to shake things up a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now allow me to explain\Nhow this groundbreaking
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,trap card of mine works\Nin case you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have two kinds of creatures on the\Nfield, a wind monster and a dark monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And one of those two monsters\Nis about to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That is up to you, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So his trap card forces me to choose\None of my own monsters to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.83,0:17:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If I choose wind, I lose my slate warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I choose dark, my vampire's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose my creature of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Earthshaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallow his Vampire Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he pick that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's Vampire Lord was much\Nstronger than his other monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,when Kaiba's Vampire is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,it comes right back to the\Nfield in his next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may be a pain in the butt, but\Nhe knows how to play duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to say\Ngoodbye to your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Slate warrior attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're completely defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is looking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba made a good move,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but Noah's still ahead of him by\Nalmost 2,000 life points, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll be plenty of time to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.87,0:18:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.83,0:18:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you and I just got\Noff on the wrong foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's time to wash\Naway our differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And this should help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Giant Flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you packed a virtual swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that is,\Nbut it doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A tidal wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for your legs! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to drown out my competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your monster\Nneeds a life jacket. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My slate warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Flushed right out of the game, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not the only\None! Look! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster in my graveyard\Nis getting washed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you to see\Nwhat my Deck Master can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you never picked a Deck Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, forgive me for being so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.89,0:19:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Freak Boy up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my Deck Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinato's Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.13,0:19:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.85,0:19:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the size of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That boat's your Deck Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Now, Seto,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,my great Ark will allow me to sail\Naway with everything you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,your company and your brother!
